<BasePage>
<h3>Freshers' Week</h3>
We will have a stand at the sports fair on Monday where you can come and talk to us. We'll also be signing people up for trial lessons during the fair.

<h3>Mailing List</h3>
<p>The gliding club mailing list is the main route of communication, where weekly flying is organised and announcements are made. To subscribe, email <a href="mailto:sympa@mlist.is.ed.ac.uk">sympa@mlist.is.ed.ac.uk</a> with the text "subscribe gliding Firstname Lastname" (withot quotes) in the body of the message, where, of course, you substitute your first and last name.</p>

<h3>Mail</h3>
<p>Snail mail should be directed at: Edinburgh University Gliding Club, Sports Union Office, 48 Pleasance, Edinburgh EH8 9TJ</p>

<h3>Email</h3>
<p>You can email the President or Secretary, for example to request trial flight information, at <a href="mailto:gliding@ed.ac.uk">gliding@ed.ac.uk</a>.</p>

<h3>WhatsApp</h3>
<p>You can join the WhatsApp group chat for EUGC related matters <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/H8miD7nqOmc3K6WmqeG3St?mode=ems_copy_t">here</a>. We sometimes organise last minute flying, curries, and trips through the WhatsApp group.</p>

</BasePage>
